%% CrestFlow - Sequence Diagram: x402 Payment (report level)
%% Type: UML sequence diagram
%% Rule: free tier versus paid query, settlement only on success.
sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant API as REST API and x402
  participant COP as Copilot
  participant F as x402.org Facilitator

  Client->>API: query

  alt free tier available
    API->>COP: forward query
    COP-->>API: answer
    API-->>Client: 200, free query counted
  else payment required
    API-->>Client: 402 payment required
    Client->>API: EIP-3009 payment signature
    API->>F: verify
    F-->>API: valid
    API->>COP: forward query
    COP-->>API: answer
    API->>F: settle
    F-->>API: settlement receipt
    API-->>Client: 200 with payment receipt
  end

  note over API: Ten free queries per day<br/>for authenticated users
  note over API: Anonymous agents always pay<br/>0.01 USD on Base USDC
  note over API: Settlement runs only<br/>after a 2xx response
